eeping suited tiles (like B1, B6, T7) offers more potential to form Chows if we draw connecting tiles, as we have some two-tile sequences (T3-T4-T5; B5-B6).\n5. This discard is relatively safe given the history and maintains our hand's structure towards a possible mixed hand.\n\nAnswer: Play F4"}
